= interfield dependencies

We want to support interfield dependencies within forms through simple expressions.

Using either boolean values (constants) or simple expressions in the following properties:
- required, 
- readOnly
- visible 
These simple expressions allow the states of these fields to be dynamic, based on the values of other fields.

Constants (strings, numbers, booleans) can be used in these expressions. When referring to other fields, you can do the following:
- either assign the GenericInputItem to a new SimpleExpression
- manually use string representation by prefixing the field id with the # character.

More documentation about simple expressions: https://api.sdworx.com/functionalities-doc/Documentation/Integration/Domains/forms.html?tabs=currency#expressions

