## Validation & error messages
### Operators and methods
The following operators are available, which are also available as static methods:

|Operator|Method Variant|Description|Example|Error message|
|--|--|--|--|--|
|!|Not|Not|||
|&|And|And|||
||Or|Or|||
|>|GreaterThan|Greater than|||
|>=|GreaterThanOrEqual|Greater than or equal to|||
|<|LessThan|Less than|||
|<=|LessThanOrEqual|Less than or equal to|||

A few others are available as static methods:

|Method|Description|Example|Error message|
|--|--|--|--|
|AreEqual|Check if two fields are equal| ||
|IsEmpty|Check if the field is empty| ||
|Contains|Check if the field contains a certain value| ||
